sequenceDiagram
  participant Sim as Simulateur Zigbee
  participant MQTT as Mosquitto local
  participant HA as Home Assistant
  participant Apple as Apple Maison
  Sim->>MQTT: MQTT Discovery + états retenus
  MQTT->>HA: Entités simulées
  HA->>MQTT: Commande simulée
  MQTT->>Sim: Commande
  Sim->>MQTT: État confirmé
  HA->>Apple: HomeKit Bridge (optionnel)
